  "description": {
   "en": "Daisuke Niwa is an ordinary, if slightly unlucky, middle school student. On his fourteenth birthday, he comes down with a 'condition' that has plagued the men in his family for three hundred years. When he sees his crush, Risa, he transforms into his alter ego, the phantom thief Dark Mousy. Unfortunately, when Dark Mousy sees his crush, Risa's twin Riku, he transforms back into Daisuke. The only cure for this craziness is if Daisuke can get Risa to fall in love with him...",
   "ja": "14歳の誕生日、丹羽大助の身に異変が起きた。好きな女の子のことを強く意識すると、“伝説の大怪盗”ダークに変身してしまうのだ!! フツーの恋愛がしたいのに…どうなる大助の人生!?"
  },
